stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> provisioning : POST /api/voice/sessions 先占账
  provisioning --> desired : 建 thread 拿到回执
  provisioning --> cancelled : stop 时由 provisioner 收尾
  provisioning --> failed : 副作用无法完成
  desired --> claimed : voice 进程认领 拿到 lease
  desired --> cancelled : stop
  claimed --> warming : 起 Codex 前台 进语音房
  warming --> live : founder 在房
  warming --> failed : founder 未到 或 前台起不来
  live --> ending : stop 或 founder 离房 或 口令退出
  ending --> ended : 念完当前块 离房 写信号
  claimed --> failed : lease 丢失
  live --> failed : lease 丢失 或 前台断线
  ending --> failed : 收尾超时
  ended --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  failed --> [*]
